","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-02-01T02:06:53Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/580979538","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3482#issuecomment-580979538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3482","id":580979538,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU4MDk3OTUzOA==","user":{"login":"jaki","id":16715704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE1NzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16715704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki","html_url":"https://github.com/jaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-02-01T02:08:39Z","updated_at":"2020-02-01T02:09:34Z","body":"Here is a repro to show that intents whose keys begin with `kNullHigh` may not be visible during a `SELECT`.  This is in YSQL on a non-colocated database.\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nCREATE TABLE t (i int, j int, PRIMARY KEY (j DESC));\r\nCREATE INDEX ON t (i ASC);\r\nINSERT INTO t VALUES (1, 2), (3, 4);\r\nBEGIN;\r\nINSERT INTO t VALUES (null, 6);\r\nSELECT i FROM t ORDER BY i NULLS LAST;\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n i\r\n---\r\n 1\r\n 3\r\n(2 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nCOMMIT;\r\nSELECT i FROM t ORDER BY i NULLS LAST;\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n i\r\n---\r\n 1\r\n 3\r\n\r\n(3 rows)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/580979538/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jaki","id":16715704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE1NzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16715704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki","html_url":"https://github.com/jaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2999015749,"node_id":"MDE3OlJlbmFtZWRUaXRsZUV2ZW50Mjk5OTAxNTc0OQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/2999015749","actor":{"login":"jaki","id":16715704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE1NzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16715704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki","html_url":"https://github.com/jaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com